[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3367979)[0m 4. **Layers are consecutive from bottom to top, with no unnecessary empty top layer.**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3367979)[0m 5. **The structure may have at most 3 layers.**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=3367979)[0m 6. **For a top view, a cell is 1 exactly when at least one layer contains a block at that row and column.**
